WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:15.852
Ben closed his eyes as Zork plunged toward the floor.

2
00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:18.073
Then he heard the sound of cheering.

3
00:00:18.614 --> 00:00:22.836
Ben opened his eyes to see Zork bouncing in a safety net below the high wire.

4
00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:28.760
"Phew!" Ben thought as Zork rolled out of the net and walked back to the ladder.

5
00:00:30.472 --> 00:00:36.015
Ben expected to see Zork pump his fist like he always did, but for once Zork didn't say

6
00:00:36.055 --> 00:00:36.415
a word.

7
00:00:36.435 --> 00:00:42.058
"Spy!" Ringmaster Ronny suddenly shouted.

8
00:00:42.538 --> 00:00:43.919
Ben's eyes went wide.

9
00:00:44.359 --> 00:00:46.980
The ringmaster was staring directly up at him.

10
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.861
"Go away now!"

11
00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.662
Ringmaster Ronny said.

12
00:00:50.682 --> 00:00:53.584
"Or face the wrath of the circus!"

13
00:00:54.276 --> 00:00:57.658
Ben quickly floated down to his friends, and they hurried away.

14
00:00:57.678 --> 00:01:01.280
"I told you that was a bad idea!"

15
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:02.281
Jen said.

16
00:01:07.524 --> 00:01:13.467
That night Ben tossed and turned in bed while Sid rambled on about his favorite baseball team, the

17
00:01:13.507 --> 00:01:17.090
Ghosts. Ben tried to listen to his little brother.

18
00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:20.792
But all he could think about was the scene in the gym that afternoon.

19
00:01:21.952 --> 00:01:24.233
Things had appeared pretty normal at the practice.

20
00:01:24.694 --> 00:01:26.495
But two things were nagging at Ben.

21
00:01:27.255 --> 00:01:30.757
One thing was Ronny's ominous warning about the wrath of the circus.

22
00:01:30.777 --> 00:01:34.979
"Why does he keep threatening us?"

23
00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:36.080
Ben thought.

24
00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:40.482
The other thing bothering him was the expression on the performers' faces.

25
00:01:41.023 --> 00:01:45.445
They'd all been staring straight ahead "Right, Ben?"

26
00:01:45.825 --> 00:01:46.906
Sid asked suddenly.

27
00:01:46.926 --> 00:01:50.088
"Don't you think the Ghosts are the best team in the Monster League?

28
00:01:50.412 --> 00:01:52.494
They could even win the Weird Series this year!"

29
00:01:52.514 --> 00:01:55.476
"Yes," Ben mumbled.

30
00:01:55.496 --> 00:01:56.897
"Go to sleep, Sid."

31
00:01:58.498 --> 00:02:01.260
It took about thirty more minutes for Sid to fall asleep.

32
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:05.843
By the time Sid was snoring softly, Ben's mind was made up.

33
00:02:06.784 --> 00:02:11.287
When he saw Winnie at school tomorrow, he'd try again to ask her about the circus.

34
00:02:11.307 --> 00:02:14.729
"Once she sees how worried I am," Ben thought.

35
00:02:14.749 --> 00:02:18.132
"She'll definitely start spilling circus secrets."

36
00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:32.443
"Winnie!" Ben called, spotting her as she was about to enter the building the next morning.

37
00:02:32.463 --> 00:02:33.704
"Wait up!"

38
00:02:37.927 --> 00:02:42.850
Ben noticed right away that her expression didn't look blank today—it looked furious.

39
00:02:43.791 --> 00:02:44.491
Ben gulped.

40
00:02:44.511 --> 00:02:46.753
"What's wrong?"

41
00:02:48.093 --> 00:02:48.894
"What's wrong?"

42
00:02:49.314 --> 00:02:49.995
she repeated.

43
00:02:50.015 --> 00:02:55.178
"What's wrong is that you peeked through the window yesterday to spy on the circus—and me!"

44
00:02:55.759 --> 00:02:57.420
Her eyes flashed with anger.

45
00:02:58.348 --> 00:02:59.589
"What were you thinking, Ben?

46
00:03:00.029 --> 00:03:03.010
Ringmaster Ronny wants the show to be a surprise for the audience.

47
00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:04.691
You could ruin everything!"

48
00:03:04.711 --> 00:03:08.072
"I I was worried about you," he blurted out.

49
00:03:08.092 --> 00:03:09.853
"Worried about me?"

50
00:03:11.293 --> 00:03:11.914
She laughed.

51
00:03:11.934 --> 00:03:13.975
"Why? Because I was having fun?"

52
00:03:14.915 --> 00:03:15.575
He flushed.

53
00:03:16.356 --> 00:03:20.417
"No. Because I think there's something weird about the circus and Ringmaster Ronny."

54
00:03:21.298 --> 00:03:21.958
She sniffed.

55
00:03:21.978 --> 00:03:26.620
"Obviously you just don't understand the circus or humans.

56
00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.781
Maybe you're even jealous that you're not part of the show!"

57
00:03:30.622 --> 00:03:33.663
"I'm not jealous," Ben said.

58
00:03:33.683 --> 00:03:36.244
"Like I just said, I'm worried.

59
00:03:36.604 --> 00:03:40.926
Something is wrong, but you're so wrapped up in the circus, you can't see it yourself."

60
00:03:43.046 --> 00:03:44.567
"You're right," Winnie said.

61
00:03:44.587 --> 00:03:46.148
"Something is wrong.

62
00:03:46.508 --> 00:03:48.048
And I can even see how to fix it."

63
00:03:48.068 --> 00:03:50.469
"Great!" Ben said.

64
00:03:50.489 --> 00:03:51.970
"What will you do?"

65
00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:54.691
"Break up with you!"

66
00:03:55.812 --> 00:03:59.257
"What?" Ben felt his heart drop into his feet.

67
00:03:59.277 --> 00:04:02.658
"But—but—" "Good-bye!"

68
00:04:03.138 --> 00:04:05.558
Winnie spun around and marched into the building.

69
00:04:08.439 --> 00:04:12.941
Ben drifted through the school day, feeling more upset and confused than ever.

70
00:04:16.141 --> 00:04:21.583
In cooking class, he usually sat with Winnie and Mog, but today he found a seat next to

71
00:04:21.643 --> 00:04:23.463
Jen. "Students!"

72
00:04:23.944 --> 00:04:24.984
Mr. Icky began.

73
00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:27.842
"We're going to cook with sticky cobwebs.

74
00:04:28.422 --> 00:04:34.686
As you probably know, they're a wonderful ingredient, delicious in things like rat soufflé and salamander soup.

75
00:04:34.926 --> 00:04:37.868
Today we're going to add them to a spicy critter stew.

76
00:04:38.288 --> 00:04:40.309
Let's start cooking, monsters!"

77
00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.931
As the students began working, Mr.

78
00:04:43.991 --> 00:04:47.373
Scribblebottom wandered around the room, filming everything.

79
00:04:48.234 --> 00:04:51.416
He stopped at Mog's table and pointed his camera in Mog's face.

80
00:04:52.224 --> 00:04:55.386
"Has your diet changed since you became a circus performer?"

81
00:04:55.747 --> 00:04:56.307
he asked.

82
00:04:57.708 --> 00:04:59.869
"Um, not really," Mog said.

83
00:04:59.889 --> 00:05:04.312
"I still eat a lot of fried bat wings and moldy chip cookies."

84
00:05:04.332 --> 00:05:08.115
"Fascinating!" the filmmaker said.

85
00:05:08.875 --> 00:05:10.336
Ben watched him approach Winnie.

86
00:05:10.356 --> 00:05:12.978
"What about you, young witch?"

87
00:05:13.479 --> 00:05:14.639
the filmmaker asked.

88
00:05:14.659 --> 00:05:16.781
"Excuse me, Ben?"

89
00:05:18.902 --> 00:05:20.563
Jen cleared her throat loudly.

90
00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:24.881
"I've asked you three times to pass the newt intestines."

91
00:05:25.562 --> 00:05:29.343
"Oops, sorry, Jen," He passed the jar and sighed.

92
00:05:29.363 --> 00:05:32.685
"I don't know what to do.

93
00:05:33.165 --> 00:05:35.326
There has to be a way to get Winnie back, right?"

94
00:05:35.346 --> 00:05:40.608
"Like I said five minutes ago, I'm sure you two will make up soon."

95
00:05:41.288 --> 00:05:46.170
She dropped the newt intestines into their cauldron, causing the stew to bubble and froth.

96
00:05:46.190 --> 00:05:50.072
"But for now why don't you just focus on cooking?

97
00:05:50.824 --> 00:05:52.927
It's time to add the sticky cobwebs.

98
00:05:53.467 --> 00:05:55.209
Can you measure out about half a cup?"

99
00:05:56.330 --> 00:06:02.718
"Sure." Ben heaved another miserable sigh and did as Jen had asked.
